ass=\"t-li1\"><span class=\"t-li\">1)</span> Default constructor. <a href=\"/w/cpp/language/value_initialization\">Value-initializes</a> the underlying view <a href=\"/w/cpp/ranges/drop_while_view#Data_members\"><code><i>base_</i></code></a> and the predicate <a href=\"/w/cpp/ranges/drop_while_view#Data_members\"><code><i>pred_</i></code></a>.</div>\n<div class=\"t-li1\"><span class=\"t-li\">2)</span> Move constructs the underlying view <code><i>base_</i></code> from <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">base</span></code> and the predicate <code><i>pred_</i></code> from <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">pred</span></code>.</div>\n<h3 id=\"Parameters\">Parameters</h3>\n<table class=\"t-par-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-par\">\n<td> base\n</td>\n<td> -\n</td>\n<td> underlying view\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-par\">\n<td> pred\n</td>\n<td> -\n</td>\n<td> predicate\n</td></tr></table>\n<h3 id=\"Example\">Example</h3>\n<div class=\"t-example\">\n<pre data-lang=\"cpp\"><code><span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;functional&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;iostream&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;ranges&gt;</span>\n&nbsp;\n<span class=\"kw4\">int</span> main<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n    <span class=\"kw4\">static</span> <span class=\"kw4\">constexpr</span> <span class=\"kw4\">auto</span> a <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> <span class=\"br0\">{</span><span class=\"sy2\">-</span><span class=\"nu0\">2</span>, <span class=\"sy2\">-</span><span class=\"nu0\">7</span>, <span class=\"sy2\">-</span><span class=\"nu0\">1</span>, <span class=\"sy2\">-</span><span class=\"nu0\">8</span>, <span class=\"sy2\">-</span><span class=\"nu0\">2</span>, <span class=\"sy2\">+-+</span><span class=\"nu0\">8</span>, <span class=\"nu0\">3</span>, <span class=\"nu0\">1</span>, <span class=\"nu0\">4</span>, <span class=\"nu0\">1</span>, <span class=\"nu0\">5</span><span class=\"br0\">}</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <span class=\"kw4\">auto</span> positive <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> <span class=\"br0\">[</span><span class=\"br0\">]</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"kw4\">int</span> x<span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"br0\">{</span> <span class=\"kw1\">return</span> <span class=\"nu0\">0</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span> x<span class=\"sy4\">;</span> <span class=\"br0\">}</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <span class=\"kw1\">for</span> <span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"kw4\">auto</span> v <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> std<span class=\"sy4\">::</span><a href=\"/w/cpp/ranges/drop_while_view\"><span class=\"kw2947\">ranges::<span class=\"me2\">drop_while_view</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">{</span>a, <a href=\"/w/cpp/utility/functional/not_fn\"><span class=\"kw1056\">std::<span class=\"me2\">not_fn</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span>positive<span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"br0\">}</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span> <span class=\"kw4\">int</span> x <span class=\"sy4\">:</span> v<span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n        <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> x <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">' '</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">'<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>'</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">}</span></code></pre>\n<p>Output:\n</p>\n<pre data-output=\"1\"><code>3 1 4 1 5</code></pre> \n</div>\n<h3 id=\"Defect_reports\">Defect reports</h3>\n<p>The following behavior-changing defect reports were applied retroactively to previously published C++ standards.\n</p>\n<table class=\"dsctable\">\n<tr>\n<th>DR\n</th>\n<th>Applied to\n</th>\n<th>Behavior as published\n</th>\n<th>Correct behavior\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"external text\" href=\"https://cplusplus.github.io/LWG/issue3714\" data-external=\"1\">LWG 3714</a><br>(<a class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wg21.link/P2711R1\" data-external=\"1\">P2711R1</a>)\n</td>\n<td>C++20\n</td>\n<td>the multi-parameter constructor was not explicit\n</td>\n<td>made explicit\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wg21.link/P2325R3\" data-external=\"1\">P2325R3</a>\n</td>\n<td>C++20\n</td>\n<td>if <code>Pred</code> is not <a href=\"/w/cpp/concepts/default_initializable\"><code>default_initializable</code></a>, the default constructor<br>constructs a <code>drop_while_view</code> which does not contain an <code>Pred</code>\n</td>\n<td>the <code>drop_while_view</code> is also<br>not <a href=\"/w/cpp/concepts/default_initializable\"><code>default_initializable</code></a>\n</td></tr></table>","headings":[{"depth":3,"text":"Parameters","id":"Parameters"},{"depth":3,"text":"Example","id":"Example"},{"depth":3,"text":"Defect reports","id":"Defect_reports"}],"breadcrumbs":[{"path":"","title":"C++ reference"},{"path":"ranges","title":"Ranges library (since C++20)"},{"path":"ranges/drop_while_view","title":"std::ranges::views::drop_while, std::ranges::drop_while_view"}],"children":[],"map":{"label":"std::ranges::drop_while_view<V,Pred>::drop_while_view","children":[{"label":"Declarations","note":"2 declarations; revisions: since C++20. Constructs a drop_while_view."},{"label":"Parameters","note":"base, pred"},{"label":"Example"},{"label":"Defect reports","note":"The following behavior-changing defect reports were applied retroactively to previously published C++ standards."}]},"standards":["C++20"],"wordCount":179,"codeBlockCount":2}
